{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p></p>\n<p>去韓國追星想提升搶飛運氣，不少粉絲都會專程去江南這座擁有過千年歷史的寺廟！這裡最出名就是多款祈福手鍊，連淨漢、成玹、Sion等韓星都有佩戴，成為追星族熱門打卡朝聖點。\n</p>\n<br/>\n寺廟的祈福手鍊按不同願望分類，無論自用祈求演唱會順利買飛，抑或買來當手信送給追星朋友都好適合。參拜方式亦與一般燒香不同，參拜者可購買蠟燭或供米，在上面寫下姓名及心願後祈福。\n<p>👇 留言「想知」，即刻DM你寺廟詳細地址、交通攻略，仲有各款手鍊韓文對照及寓意懶人包！</p>\n<p>潮聖地圖 ｜ 為了一場盛會，絕對可以遊歷全世界！無論是花火祭、F1還是演唱會等，就是要親臨現場感受嗰份震撼！</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179491682745063871_1928684186afc41dc34ddc.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179491682745063871_1928684186afc41dc34ddc.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：@nata_yau)</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<blockquote><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/Df1uGd2TqAI/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</a></p></blockquote>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/ig%e7%b2%be%e9%81%b8/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">IG精選</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%a5%89%e6%81%a9%e5%af%ba/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">奉恩寺</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e9%9f%93%e5%9c%8b%e8%bf%bd%e6%98%9f/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">韓國追星</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e9%a6%96%e7%88%be/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">首爾</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n圖片來源：@nata_yau資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/Df1uGd2TqAI/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Gotrip IG</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生活</a>\nNov 17 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T12:13:42.572383+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":417,"images":1,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T12:00:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T14:08:35.732122+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T12:07:00.419218+00:00","content_hash":"51ff805a4ded1a46ebbebd2e5b6d2596bcb5f545cf4a147823044901ee762062","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}